@startuml

component "Consumer Contract Wallet" as Wallet
component "Wallet-held ETH/ERC20 Assets" as WalletAssets
component "Controller Contract Interface" as Controller
component "Token Whitelist" as TokenWhitelist
component "TKN Holder Contract" as TknHolder
component "Licence/Oracle-related Components" as LicenceOracle
component "ENS Resolution" as EnsResolution
component "Generated Go Bindings" as GoBindings
component "Oracle/Rate Provider Contract" as OracleRateProviderContract
component "Supported Contract Targets" as SupportedContracts
node "Ethereum Network" as Ethereum
cloud "Ethereum Name Service (ENS)" as ENS
interface "Oracle/Rate Provider Interface" as RateProvider
component "Gas Tank" as GasTank
node "Owner Address" as OwnerAddress

Wallet --> WalletAssets : holds/custodies ETH and ERC20
OwnerAddress --> Wallet : controls/owns
Wallet --> EnsResolution : resolve supporting contract locations
Wallet --> Controller : control and confirmation operations using ENS-resolved address
Wallet --> TokenWhitelist : token support, exchange-rate, loadability, burnability using ENS-resolved address
Wallet --> OracleRateProviderContract : exchange-rate data using ENS-resolved address
Wallet --> LicenceOracle : supporting contract interactions using ENS-resolved address

EnsResolution --> ENS : name resolution
EnsResolution --> Ethereum : runtime dependency
EnsResolution ..> Controller : resolves address
EnsResolution ..> TokenWhitelist : resolves address
EnsResolution ..> OracleRateProviderContract : resolves address
EnsResolution ..> LicenceOracle : resolves address

OracleRateProviderContract -- RateProvider : provides interface

GoBindings --> Controller : Call adminCount/controllerCount, Transact(methodName, params)/Transfer
GoBindings --> SupportedContracts : Call/Transact(methodName, params)/Transfer for supported contracts
GoBindings --> Ethereum : contract call, transact, transfer

TknHolder --> TokenWhitelist : burn eligibility constrained by burnability

GasTank --> OwnerAddress : gas-payment ETH maintained on

@enduml
